  "details": "I think you guys should make it so that you can only grab two movable objects (Plates,Cups,Pencils,Etc) that you can move at a time so it negates people using modified clients to put a bunch of movable objects around you if it tries to grab a third one it just denies it I don't think that would ruin world creativity because you're only using two hands in the world. So for example I join the world and I can only touch to objects in the world and then another person joins and they can only touch to objects in the world too.",
